    'The code is only sent after the right password. It expires in 10 minutes and allows 5 tries; repeated failures block the address for 15 minutes.' => 'Msimbo hutumwa tu baada ya nenosiri sahihi. Unaisha muda baada ya dakika 10 na unaruhusu majaribio 5; makosa ya kurudia huzuia anwani kwa dakika 15.',
    'Changing the password or the e-mail of an account makes all its trusted devices ask for a code again.' => 'Kubadilisha nenosiri au barua pepe ya akaunti hufanya vifaa vyake vyote vinavyoaminika viombe msimbo tena.',
    'Login boxes that work without reloading the page (some themes) cannot show the code step: those users are asked to log in from the normal login page.' => 'Visanduku vya kuingia vinavyofanya kazi bila kupakia ukurasa upya (baadhi ya mandhari) haviwezi kuonyesha hatua ya msimbo: watumiaji hao huombwa kuingia kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa kawaida wa kuingia.',
    'If you are ever locked out, add define(\'DRACO_MFA_OFF\', true); to wp-config.php, log in, fix the problem and remove the line. Only someone with access to the server can do this, unlike a "skip" button.' => 'Ukifungiwa nje, ongeza define(\'DRACO_MFA_OFF\', true); kwenye wp-config.php, ingia, tatua tatizo na uondoe mstari huo. Ni mwenye ufikiaji wa seva pekee anayeweza kufanya hivi, tofauti na kitufe cha "ruka".',
    'The e-mail login code of OPNV-WP is already on in this site. Use one of them, not both.' => 'Msimbo wa kuingia kwa barua pepe wa OPNV-WP tayari umewashwa kwenye tovuti hii. Tumia mmoja wao, si yote mawili.',
    'Without SMTP the code may not arrive and you would be locked out. Set up Site mail (SMTP) first.' => 'Bila SMTP msimbo huenda usifike na ungefungiwa nje. Weka kwanza barua pepe ya tovuti (SMTP).',
    'Too many attempts. Try again later.' => 'Majaribio mengi mno. Jaribu tena baadaye.',
    'This account needs a code sent by e-mail. Log in from %s to receive it.' => 'Akaunti hii inahitaji msimbo unaotumwa kwa barua pepe. Ingia kutoka %s ili uupokee.',
    'The login code could not be sent by e-mail. If you own this site and are locked out, add define(\'DRACO_MFA_OFF\', true); to wp-config.php.' => 'Msimbo wa kuingia haukuweza kutumwa kwa barua pepe. Ikiwa wewe ni mmiliki wa tovuti hii na umefungiwa nje, ongeza define(\'DRACO_MFA_OFF\', true); kwenye wp-config.php.',
    'Hello %s,' => 'Habari %s,',
    '[%s] Confirm your recovery e-mail' => '[%s] Thibitisha barua pepe yako ya kurejesha',
    'Confirm your recovery e-mail' => 'Thibitisha barua pepe yako ya kurejesha',
    'Type this code in the recovery e-mail screen to confirm the change:' => 'Andika msimbo huu kwenye skrini ya barua pepe ya kurejesha ili kuthibitisha mabadiliko:',
    'It expires in 15 minutes. If you did not ask for this, someone has access to your account: change your password.' => 'Unaisha muda baada ya dakika 15. Ikiwa hukuuomba, kuna mtu anayeweza kufikia akaunti yako: badilisha nenosiri lako.',
    '[%s] Your login code' => '[%s] Msimbo wako wa kuingia',
    'Your login code' => 'Msimbo wako wa kuingia',
    'Use this code to finish logging in:' => 'Tumia msimbo huu kumaliza kuingia:',
    'It expires in %d minutes. If you did not try to log in, someone knows your password: change it.' => 'Unaisha muda baada ya dakika %d. Ikiwa hukujaribu kuingia, kuna mtu anayejua nenosiri lako: libadilishe.',
    'The code has expired. Log in again.' => 'Muda wa msimbo umeisha. Ingia tena.',
    'The recovery e-mail cannot be used right now. Try again later.' => 'Barua pepe ya kurejesha haiwezi kutumika sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baadaye.',
    'A new code is on its way. Check your spam folder too.' => 'Msimbo mpya uko njiani. Angalia pia folda ya barua taka.',
    'The code could not be sent again.' => 'Msimbo haukuweza kutumwa tena.',
    'Too many attempts. Log in again.' => 'Majaribio mengi mno. Ingia tena.',
    'Wrong code.' => 'Msimbo si sahihi.',
    'We have sent a 6-digit code to %s. Check your spam folder too.' => 'Tumetuma msimbo wa tarakimu 6 kwa %s. Angalia pia folda ya barua taka.',
    'Login code' => 'Msimbo wa kuingia',
    'Code' => 'Msimbo',
