    'User / e-mail' => 'Mtumiaji / barua pepe',
    'Bot' => 'Roboti',
    'Doubtful' => 'Ya shaka',
    'No suspicious attempts yet.' => 'Hakuna majaribio ya kutiliwa shaka bado.',
    'The shield is off.' => 'Ngao imezimwa.',
    'Invalid address.' => 'Anwani si halali.',
    'Automatic: %d bot attempts in 24 h' => 'Kiotomatiki: majaribio %d ya roboti ndani ya saa 24',
    'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Open-source security by Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): anti-bot shield without captchas, e-mail confirmation of forms and sign-ups, two-step login, firewall and site mail (SMTP).' => 'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Usalama wa chanzo huria na Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): ngao dhidi ya roboti bila captcha, uthibitisho wa fomu na usajili kwa barua pepe, kuingia kwa hatua mbili, ngome ya mtandao na barua pepe ya tovuti (SMTP).',
    'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Open-source security by Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): anti-bot shield without captchas, e-mail confirmation of forms and sign-ups, two-step login, firewall, anti-copy and site mail (SMTP).' => 'Ab insomni custodita dracone. Usalama wa chanzo huria na Notorius Vision (OPNV Systems · OPNV SOLΞ): ngao dhidi ya roboti bila captcha, uthibitisho wa fomu na usajili kwa barua pepe, kuingia kwa hatua mbili, ngome ya mtandao, kuzuia kunakili na barua pepe ya tovuti (SMTP).',
    'Anti-copy' => 'Kuzuia kunakili',
    'Makes it harder to copy the whole site in one go, without getting in the way of visitors or search engines. People logged in and the addresses an administrator used are never limited. Start with "Log only" for a few days and look at the list below.' => 'Inafanya iwe vigumu kunakili tovuti nzima kwa mara moja, bila kuwazuia wageni au injini za utafutaji. Walioingia na anwani alizotumia msimamizi hawapunguziwi kamwe. Anza na "Rekodi tu" kwa siku chache na uangalie orodha hapa chini.',
    'Off' => 'Imezimwa',
    'Log only: write down what it would stop, without stopping anything' => 'Rekodi tu: inaandika ambacho ingezuia, bila kuzuia chochote',
    'Content API' => 'API ya maudhui',
    'WordPress publishes every post, page and image as JSON at /wp-json/wp/v2/, which lets anyone download the whole site in a few requests. This closes those reads to anonymous visitors; the pages themselves stay public.' => 'WordPress huchapisha kila chapisho, ukurasa na picha kama JSON kwenye /wp-json/wp/v2/, jambo linalomwezesha yeyote kupakua tovuti nzima kwa maombi machache. Hili linafunga usomaji huo kwa wageni wasiojulikana; kurasa zenyewe zinabaki za umma.',
    'Routes that stay open' => 'Njia zinazobaki wazi',
    'One per line, for example /wp/v2/posts if your theme loads more posts with JavaScript. The log below shows which routes visitors really use. Other APIs (forms, shop, embeds) are never affected.' => 'Moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano /wp/v2/posts ikiwa mandhari yako hupakia machapisho zaidi kwa JavaScript. Kumbukumbu hapa chini inaonyesha njia ambazo wageni hutumia kweli. API nyingine (fomu, duka, viambatisho) haziathiriwi kamwe.',
    'Pace' => 'Kasi',
    'More pages per minute than a person reads get "429 Too many requests" for the rest of that minute. Google, Bing, Apple and Yandex are recognised by their reverse DNS and never limited; a program that only pretends to be them is.' => 'Kurasa nyingi kwa dakika kuliko mtu anavyosoma hupata "429 Too many requests" kwa dakika iliyobaki. Google, Bing, Apple na Yandex hutambuliwa kwa DNS ya kinyume na hawapunguziwi kamwe; programu inayojifanya tu kuwa wao hupunguziwa.',
    'Pages per minute from one address' => 'Kurasa kwa dakika kutoka anwani moja',
    'Pages per minute from one network (the 256 addresses around it)' => 'Kurasa kwa dakika kutoka mtandao mmoja (anwani 256 zinazouzunguka)',
    'Only requests that reach WordPress count: images, styles and pages served by a cache do not. Each counted request writes two small counters, so on a very busy site without an object cache keep this off or in log mode.' => 'Ni maombi yanayofika WordPress pekee yanayohesabiwa: picha, mitindo na kurasa zinazotolewa na akiba hazihesabiwi. Kila ombi linalohesabiwa huandika vihesabu viwili vidogo, kwa hivyo kwenye tovuti yenye shughuli nyingi bila akiba ya vitu, iache imezimwa au katika hali ya kurekodi.',
    'content API' => 'API ya maudhui',
    'too fast, one address' => 'haraka mno, anwani moja',
    'too fast, one network' => 'haraka mno, mtandao mmoja',
    'Recent' => 'Hivi karibuni',
    'Browser' => 'Kivinjari',
    'Nothing recorded yet.' => 'Hakuna kilichorekodiwa bado.',
    'This content is not available through the API.' => 'Maudhui haya hayapatikani kupitia API.',
    'Overview' => 'Muhtasari',
    'Open source (GPL)' => 'Chanzo huria (GPL)',
    'On' => 'Imewashwa',
    'Log only' => 'Rekodi tu',
    'Everything Draco Insomnis protects on this site, at a glance. Each module can be switched on and off on its own screen.' => 'Kila kitu ambacho Draco Insomnis inalinda kwenye tovuti hii, kwa mtazamo mmoja. Kila moduli inaweza kuwashwa na kuzimwa kwenye skrini yake.',
    'bots stopped in sign-ups' => 'roboti zilizozuiwa kwenye usajili',
    'submissions checked by e-mail' => 'vilivyotumwa vilivyokaguliwa kwa barua pepe',
    'attacks seen by the firewall' => 'mashambulizi yaliyoonwa na ngome',
    'copy attempts recorded' => 'majaribio ya kunakili yaliyorekodiwa',
    'Last 7 days.' => 'Siku 7 zilizopita.',
    '%d blocked addresses or e-mails right now' => 'Anwani au barua pepe %d zimezuiwa sasa hivi',
    'Fake sign-ups are answered "done" and kept as evidence.' => 'Usajili bandia hujibiwa "imekamilika" na huhifadhiwa kama ushahidi.',
    '%d waiting for their sender to confirm' => '%d vinasubiri mtumaji athibitishe',
    'On without SMTP: confirmations may not arrive.' => 'Imewashwa bila SMTP: uthibitisho huenda usifike.',
    'Messages, comments and new accounts wait for an e-mail confirmation.' => 'Jumbe, maoni na akaunti mpya zinasubiri uthibitisho wa barua pepe.',
    'Only the password is asked for.' => 'Nenosiri pekee linaombwa.',
    'Trusted devices: 7 days without a code.' => 'Vifaa vinavyoaminika: siku 7 bila msimbo.',
    'A code at every login.' => 'Msimbo kila unapoingia.',
    'Stopping attacks.' => 'Inazuia mashambulizi.',
    'Recording attacks without stopping them.' => 'Inarekodi mashambulizi bila kuyazuia.',
    'No request is inspected.' => 'Hakuna ombi linalokaguliwa.',
    'User list hidden, failed logins limited, XML-RPC tamed.' => 'Orodha ya watumiaji imefichwa, kuingia kwa makosa kumepunguzwa, XML-RPC imedhibitiwa.',
    'Content API for anonymous visitors and pages per minute.' => 'API ya maudhui kwa wageni wasiojulikana na kurasa kwa dakika.',
    'Verified search engines are never limited.' => 'Injini za utafutaji zilizothibitishwa hazipunguziwi kamwe.',
    'Sending as %s' => 'Inatuma kama %s',
    'Login codes and confirmations depend on it.' => 'Misimbo ya kuingia na uthibitisho hutegemea hili.',
    'Checklist' => 'Orodha ya ukaguzi',
    'What makes the biggest difference, in order.' => 'Kinacholeta tofauti kubwa zaidi, kwa mpangilio.',
    'Site mail goes out through a real mailbox' => 'Barua za tovuti zinatoka kupitia sanduku halisi la barua',
    'The anti-bot shield protects sign-ups' => 'Ngao dhidi ya roboti inalinda usajili',
    'Forms and sign-ups are confirmed by e-mail' => 'Fomu na usajili vinathibitishwa kwa barua pepe',
    'Administrators log in with a code by e-mail' => 'Wasimamizi huingia kwa msimbo wa barua pepe',
    'You have a recovery e-mail' => 'Una barua pepe ya kurejesha',
    'The firewall blocks attacks (switch it from "Log only" once you have looked at what it records)' => 'Ngome inazuia mashambulizi (ihamishe kutoka "Rekodi tu" ukishaona inachorekodi)',
    'The firewall is on' => 'Ngome imewashwa',
    'Set it up' => 'Weka',
    'Administrators enter a code by e-mail.' => 'Wasimamizi huweka msimbo kutoka kwa barua pepe.',
    'Everyone who edits content enters a code by e-mail.' => 'Kila anayehariri maudhui huweka msimbo kutoka kwa barua pepe.',
    'Every user enters a code by e-mail.' => 'Kila mtumiaji huweka msimbo kutoka kwa barua pepe.',
    'Nothing is checked.' => 'Hakuna kinachokaguliwa.',
    'Writes down what it would stop, without stopping it.' => 'Inaandika ambacho ingezuia, bila kukizuia.',
    'Stops it, and writes it down.' => 'Inakizuia, na kukiandika.',
    'Writes down what it would stop, without stopping it. Start here for a few days.' => 'Inaandika ambacho ingezuia, bila kukizuia. Anza hapa kwa siku chache.',
    'Stops those requests. Five in 10 minutes put the address on the block list for 7 days.' => 'Inasimamisha maombi hayo. Matano ndani ya dakika 10 yanaweka anwani kwenye orodha ya waliozuiwa kwa siku 7.',
    'Contact Form 7, WPForms, Elementor, Divi, RealHomes, comments and new accounts.' => 'Contact Form 7, WPForms, Elementor, Divi, RealHomes, maoni na akaunti mpya.',
    'The sender gets an e-mail with a button; nothing is delivered until it is pressed.' => 'Mtumaji hupokea barua pepe yenye kitufe; hakuna kinachofikishwa hadi kibonyezwe.',
    'Missing' => 'Haipo',
    'SMTP' => 'SMTP',
    'Choose your provider and the server, encryption and port fill themselves in.' => 'Chagua mtoa huduma wako na seva, usimbaji fiche na mlango vitajijaza.',
    'Saved' => 'Imehifadhiwa',
    'Passed' => 'Imefaulu',
    'WordPress, WooCommerce and RealHomes sign-up forms.' => 'Fomu za usajili za WordPress, WooCommerce na RealHomes.',
    'A hidden trap field and a signed page stamp: people never solve puzzles.' => 'Sehemu ya mtego iliyofichwa na muhuri wa ukurasa uliotiwa saini: watu hawatatui mafumbo kamwe.',
    'Never an administrator, nor your own address.' => 'Kamwe si msimamizi, wala anwani yako mwenyewe.',
    'Active: %d' => 'Vinavyotumika: %d',
    'The header is ignored: this connection (%s) does not come from Cloudflare or from a trusted proxy. If your proxy is on the internet, add its addresses below.' => 'Kichwa kimepuuzwa: muunganisho huu (%s) hautoki Cloudflare wala kwa proksi inayoaminika. Ikiwa proksi yako iko kwenye intaneti, ongeza anwani zake hapa chini.',
    'Trusted proxies (one per line, e.g. 203.0.113.10 or 203.0.113.0/24; empty = this server and private networks)' => 'Proksi zinazoaminika (moja kwa kila mstari, mf. 203.0.113.10 au 203.0.113.0/24; wazi = seva hii na mitandao ya faragha)',
    'Forever' => 'Milele',
    'IP or range (e.g. 203.0.113.0/24)' => 'IP au safu (mf. 203.0.113.0/24)',
    'Range' => 'Safu',
    'Allowed' => 'Imeruhusiwa',
    'Your e-mail' => 'Barua pepe yako',
    'What were you doing?' => 'Ulikuwa unafanya nini?',
    'Ask for a review' => 'Omba ukaguzi',
    '[%s] Someone asks you to review a firewall block' => '[%s] Mtu anakuomba ukague kizuizi cha ngome',
    'A visitor stopped by the firewall asks for a review. Open the Firewall screen to let them through or not:' => 'Mgeni aliyezuiwa na ngome anaomba ukaguzi. Fungua skrini ya Ngome ili umruhusu kupita au la:',
    'Request sent' => 'Ombi limetumwa',
    'Thank you. The owner of the site will look at it and, if it was a mistake, let you through.' => 'Asante. Mmiliki wa tovuti ataliangalia na, ikiwa lilikuwa kosa, atakuruhusu kupita.',
    'Review: %s' => 'Ukaguzi: %s',
    'This request was stopped for security reasons. If you think this is a mistake, tell the owner of the site what you were doing:' => 'Ombi hili limesimamishwa kwa sababu za usalama. Ukidhani ni kosa, mweleze mmiliki wa tovuti ulichokuwa ukifanya:',
    'The firewall is off: switch it on and save, then test again.' => 'Ngome imezimwa: iwashe, hifadhi, kisha jaribu tena.',
    'The test could not reach the site from the server itself (some hostings do not allow it). The firewall may still work: look at "Recent attacks".' => 'Jaribio halikuweza kufikia tovuti kutoka kwenye seva yenyewe (baadhi ya wenyeji hawaruhusu). Ngome bado inaweza kufanya kazi: angalia "Mashambulizi ya hivi karibuni".',
    'The test was stopped before it reached WordPress, by the hosting\'s own firewall. Good: two layers.' => 'Jaribio lilisimamishwa kabla ya kufika WordPress, na ngome ya mwenyeji mwenyewe. Vizuri: tabaka mbili.',
    'The test attack was not recognised. Please report it to Draco Insomnis.' => 'Shambulio la jaribio halikutambuliwa. Tafadhali iarifu Draco Insomnis.',
    'Works: a database injection was recognised and blocked (403).' => 'Inafanya kazi: uingizaji kwenye hifadhidata umetambuliwa na kuzuiwa (403).',
    'Works: a database injection was recognised. In "Log only" it is written down but not stopped; switch to "Block" when you are ready.' => 'Inafanya kazi: uingizaji kwenye hifadhidata umetambuliwa. Katika "Rekodi tu" unaandikwa lakini hauzuiwi; hamia "Zuia" ukiwa tayari.',
    'Test the firewall' => 'Jaribu ngome',
    'Sends a harmless attack-shaped request to the site and tells you what happened. It is not logged.' => 'Inatuma kwa tovuti ombi lisilo na madhara lenye umbo la shambulio na kukueleza kilichotokea. Halirekodiwi.',
    '%1$d attacks seen, %2$d blocked.' => 'Mashambulizi %1$d yameonekana, %2$d yamezuiwa.',
    'Last 7 days' => 'Siku 7 zilizopita',
    'Busiest addresses' => 'Anwani zenye shughuli nyingi zaidi',
    'Waiting: %d' => 'Yanasubiri: %d',
    'Review requests' => 'Maombi ya ukaguzi',
    'People the firewall stopped can ask from the block page. Let them through for a while if it was a mistake. Draco never writes to them: answer from your own mail if you want.' => 'Watu waliozuiwa na ngome wanaweza kuomba kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa kizuizi. Waruhusu kupita kwa muda ikiwa lilikuwa kosa. Draco haiwaandikii kamwe: jibu kutoka kwa barua pepe yako mwenyewe ukipenda.',
    'Let through' => 'Ruhusu kupita',
    'Denied' => 'Limekataliwa',
    'Attacker: blocked' => 'Mshambulizi: amezuiwa',
    '24 hours' => 'Saa 24',
    'Deny' => 'Kataa',
    'Attacker' => 'Mshambulizi',
    'No requests.' => 'Hakuna maombi.',
    'country not allowed' => 'nchi hairuhusiwi',
    'The country list could not be downloaded. The filter does nothing until it is there; try "Update the country list" later.' => 'Orodha ya nchi haikuweza kupakuliwa. Kichujio hakifanyi chochote hadi iwepo; jaribu "Sasisha orodha ya nchi" baadaye.',
    'Country list downloaded.' => 'Orodha ya nchi imepakuliwa.',
    'Countries' => 'Nchi',
    'Most of your visitors may come from many countries, and an attacker changes country with a VPN. Filter only logging in, signing up and forms, and start with "Log only". Administrators, people you let through and search engines are never filtered.' => 'Wageni wako wanaweza kutoka nchi nyingi, na mshambulizi hubadilisha nchi kwa VPN. Chuja tu kuingia, usajili na fomu, na uanze na "Rekodi tu". Wasimamizi, watu uliowaruhusu kupita na injini za utafutaji hawachujwi kamwe.',
    'Filter' => 'Kichujio',
    'Refuse the countries listed' => 'Kataa nchi zilizoorodheshwa',
    'Only the countries listed' => 'Nchi zilizoorodheshwa pekee',
    'Logging in, signing up and forms (recommended)' => 'Kuingia, usajili na fomu (inapendekezwa)',
    'The whole site' => 'Tovuti nzima',
    'What to do' => 'Nini cha kufanya',
    'Countries (two-letter codes, e.g. ES, FR, DE)' => 'Nchi (misimbo ya herufi mbili, mf. ES, FR, DE)',
    'Country list: not downloaded yet (it is downloaded when you switch the filter on).' => 'Orodha ya nchi: bado haijapakuliwa (inapakuliwa unapowasha kichujio).',
    'Country list of %s.' => 'Orodha ya nchi ya %s.',
    'Update the country list' => 'Sasisha orodha ya nchi',
    'IP geolocation by %s (CC BY 4.0). Looked up on your own server: no address is sent anywhere.' => 'Utambuzi wa eneo la IP na %s (CC BY 4.0). Unatafutwa kwenye seva yako mwenyewe: hakuna anwani inayotumwa popote.',
    'The password must have at least %d characters.' => 'Nenosiri lazima liwe na angalau herufi %d.',
    'This password appears in known data breaches, so attackers try it first. Please choose another one.' => 'Nenosiri hili linaonekana katika uvujaji wa data unaojulikana, kwa hivyo washambulizi hulijaribu kwanza. Tafadhali chagua jingine.',
    'Your password appears in known data breaches.' => 'Nenosiri lako linaonekana katika uvujaji wa data unaojulikana.',
    'Attackers try those first. Change it now:' => 'Washambulizi hujaribu hayo kwanza. Libadilishe sasa:',
    'Change my password' => 'Badilisha nenosiri langu',
    'Passwords' => 'Manenosiri',
    'Applied when someone chooses a password: profile, reset and WooCommerce sign-up. Existing passwords keep working.' => 'Inatumika mtu anapochagua nenosiri: wasifu, kuweka upya na usajili wa WooCommerce. Manenosiri yaliyopo yanaendelea kufanya kazi.',
    'Minimum length' => 'Urefu wa chini',
    'No minimum (WordPress default)' => 'Hakuna kiwango cha chini (chaguo-msingi la WordPress)',
    '%d characters' => 'herufi %d',
    'recommended' => 'inapendekezwa',
    'Refuse passwords that appear in known data breaches, and warn people who log in with one' => 'Kataa manenosiri yanayoonekana katika uvujaji unaojulikana, na uwaonye wanaoingia kwa nenosiri kama hilo',
    'Asks Have I Been Pwned with only the first 5 characters of the password\'s SHA-1: the password never leaves your site. If the service does not answer in 3 seconds, the password is accepted.' => 'Inauliza Have I Been Pwned kwa herufi 5 za kwanza tu za SHA-1 ya nenosiri: nenosiri haliondoki kamwe kwenye tovuti yako. Huduma isipojibu ndani ya sekunde 3, nenosiri linakubaliwa.',
    'Send security headers on public pages (no sniffing of file types, no framing by other sites, less referrer data, no camera, microphone or location for embedded content)' => 'Tuma vichwa vya usalama kwenye kurasa za umma (bila kukisia aina za faili, bila kuwekwa kwenye fremu na tovuti nyingine, data kidogo ya chanzo, bila kamera, maikrofoni au eneo kwa maudhui yaliyopachikwa)',
    'Safe for almost every site. If another plugin or the server already sends one of them, Draco leaves it alone.' => 'Salama kwa karibu kila tovuti. Programu-jalizi nyingine au seva ikishatuma kimoja wapo, Draco hakigusi.',
    'Force HTTPS in browsers for 6 months (HSTS)' => 'Lazimisha HTTPS kwenye vivinjari kwa miezi 6 (HSTS)',
    'Only when the whole site works on HTTPS and will keep working: browsers remember it and refuse plain HTTP until it expires.' => 'Tu ikiwa tovuti nzima inafanya kazi kwa HTTPS na itaendelea hivyo: vivinjari hukumbuka na kukataa HTTP hadi muda uishe.',
    'Abuse report sent. Replies will arrive at the administrator e-mail.' => 'Ripoti ya matumizi mabaya imetumwa. Majibu yatafika kwenye barua pepe ya msimamizi.',
    'The abuse report could not be sent: WordPress could not deliver the e-mail. Check the site mail settings.' => 'Ripoti ya matumizi mabaya haikuweza kutumwa: WordPress haikuweza kuwasilisha barua pepe. Kagua mipangilio ya barua pepe ya tovuti.',
    'The abuse report was not sent: an address, subject and message are needed, and the limits (one per address every 30 days, 5 a day) must allow it.' => 'Ripoti ya matumizi mabaya haikutumwa: zinahitajika anwani, mada na ujumbe, na vikomo (moja kwa kila anwani kila siku 30, 5 kwa siku) lazima viruhusu.',
    'Report' => 'Ripoti',
    'Abuse report' => 'Ripoti ya matumizi mabaya',
    'Tell the network that owns the address what its machine did, so they can look at it. Most attacking machines are compromised: their owners are victims too. Nothing is sent until you press Send.' => 'Iambie mtandao unaomiliki anwani hiyo kile ambacho mashine yake ilifanya, ili waikague. Mashine nyingi zinazoshambulia zimeingiliwa: wamiliki wake pia ni waathiriwa. Hakuna kinachotumwa hadi ubonyeze Tuma.',
    'There is no evidence from this address.' => 'Hakuna ushahidi kutoka anwani hii.',
    'Back' => 'Rudi',
    'Not now' => 'Si sasa',
    'The registry gave no abuse contact (%s). Write the address yourself if you know it.' => 'Sajili haikutoa mawasiliano ya matumizi mabaya (%s). Andika anwani mwenyewe ikiwa unaijua.',
    'Not sent now: %s.' => 'Haikutumwa sasa: %s.',
    'To (abuse contact of the network)' => 'Kwa (mawasiliano ya matumizi mabaya ya mtandao)',
    'Message (in English, which abuse desks read; edit anything you like)' => 'Ujumbe (kwa Kiingereza, ambacho timu za matumizi mabaya husoma; badilisha chochote unachotaka)',
    'Replies go to %s. Never more than one report per address every 30 days, nor more than 5 a day.' => 'Majibu yanaenda kwa %s. Kamwe si zaidi ya ripoti moja kwa kila anwani kila siku 30, wala zaidi ya 5 kwa siku.',
    'Send the report' => 'Tuma ripoti',
    'Abuse reports sent' => 'Ripoti za matumizi mabaya zilizotumwa',
    'The last 20. Replies arrive at the administrator e-mail.' => '20 za mwisho. Majibu hufika kwenye barua pepe ya msimamizi.',
    'Accounts that can change the site' => 'Akaunti zinazoweza kubadilisha tovuti',
    'Administrators, editors and shop managers only work once you approved them, so an account created by an attack cannot log in. If the site e-mail, its address, the default role or open registration change without you, they are all paused until you confirm from your e-mail.' => 'Wasimamizi, wahariri na wasimamizi wa duka hufanya kazi tu baada ya kuwaidhinisha, hivyo akaunti iliyoundwa na shambulio haiwezi kuingia. Ikiwa barua pepe ya tovuti, anwani yake, jukumu la msingi au usajili wazi vitabadilika bila wewe, zote husimamishwa hadi uthibitishe kutoka kwa barua pepe yako.',
    'Only approved accounts can change the site' => 'Akaunti zilizoidhinishwa pekee ndizo zinaweza kubadilisha tovuti',
    'Switching it on approves you and keeps your e-mail for confirmations. Other privileged accounts wait until you approve them below.' => 'Kuiwasha kunakuidhinisha na kuhifadhi barua pepe yako kwa uthibitisho. Akaunti nyingine zenye mamlaka zinasubiri hadi uziidhinishe hapa chini.',
    'Paused: a sensitive setting changed. The confirmation link was sent to the e-mail kept when the lock was switched on.' => 'Imesimamishwa: mpangilio nyeti umebadilika. Kiungo cha uthibitisho kilitumwa kwa barua pepe iliyohifadhiwa wakati kufuli kilipowashwa.',
    'Confirmations go to %s.' => 'Uthibitisho unaenda kwa %s.',
    'Role' => 'Jukumu',
    'State' => 'Hali',
    'Approved' => 'Imeidhinishwa',
    'Waiting for approval' => 'Inasubiri idhini',
    'Withdraw approval' => 'Ondoa idhini',
    'Approve' => 'Idhinisha',
    'Accounts created from the command line (WP-CLI) also wait for approval. Locked out? Add define(\'DRACO_LOCK_OFF\', true); to wp-config.php, log in, fix it and remove the line.' => 'Akaunti zilizoundwa kwa mstari wa amri (WP-CLI) pia zinasubiri idhini. Umefungiwa nje? Ongeza define(\'DRACO_LOCK_OFF\', true); kwenye wp-config.php, ingia, rekebisha kisha ondoa mstari huo.',
    'DRACO_LOCK_OFF is set in wp-config.php: accounts that can change the site are not checked. Remove that line once you are back in.' => 'DRACO_LOCK_OFF imewekwa katika wp-config.php: akaunti zinazoweza kubadilisha tovuti hazikaguliwi. Ondoa mstari huo ukishaingia tena.',
    'Not available on multisite networks yet.' => 'Bado haipatikani kwenye mitandao ya tovuti nyingi.',
    'Accounts that can change this site are paused because a sensitive setting changed. The site owner has been sent an e-mail to confirm.' => 'Akaunti zinazoweza kubadilisha tovuti hii zimesimamishwa kwa sababu mpangilio nyeti umebadilika. Mmiliki wa tovuti ametumiwa barua pepe ili kuthibitisha.',
    'This account can change the site, so it has to be approved by the site owner first. The owner has been sent an e-mail.' => 'Akaunti hii inaweza kubadilisha tovuti, kwa hivyo lazima kwanza iidhinishwe na mmiliki wa tovuti. Mmiliki ametumiwa barua pepe.',
    'Privileged accounts' => 'Akaunti zenye mamlaka',
    'This link has expired or was already used.' => 'Kiungo hiki kimeisha muda au tayari kimetumika.',
    'Done. The account can log in now.' => 'Imekamilika. Akaunti sasa inaweza kuingia.',
    'A sensitive setting of the site changed (its e-mail, its address, the default role or open registration) and every account that can change the site was paused. Confirm only if you or someone you trust made that change.' => 'Mpangilio nyeti wa tovuti umebadilika (barua pepe yake, anwani yake, jukumu la msingi au usajili wazi) na kila akaunti inayoweza kubadilisha tovuti imesimamishwa. Thibitisha tu ikiwa wewe au mtu unayemwamini ndiye aliyefanya mabadiliko hayo.',
    'The account %1$s (%2$s) can change the site and is waiting for your approval. Approve it only if you know who it belongs to.' => 'Akaunti %1$s (%2$s) inaweza kubadilisha tovuti na inasubiri idhini yako. Iidhinishe tu ikiwa unajua ni ya nani.',
    '[%s] Accounts that can change the site were paused' => '[%s] Akaunti zinazoweza kubadilisha tovuti zimesimamishwa',
    'A sensitive setting of your site changed (its e-mail, its address, the default role or open registration) without an approved administrator doing it, so every account that can change the site was paused. If you made the change, confirm it here. If not, your site may be compromised: do not confirm, and ask whoever manages your hosting for help.' => 'Mpangilio nyeti wa tovuti yako umebadilika (barua pepe yake, anwani yake, jukumu la msingi au usajili wazi) bila msimamizi aliyeidhinishwa kufanya hivyo, kwa hivyo kila akaunti inayoweza kubadilisha tovuti imesimamishwa. Ikiwa wewe ndiye uliyefanya mabadiliko, thibitisha hapa. Ikiwa sivyo, huenda tovuti yako imeingiliwa: usithibitishe, na muombe msaada anayesimamia upangishaji wako.',
    '[%s] An account is waiting for your approval' => '[%s] Akaunti inasubiri idhini yako',
    'The account %1$s (%2$s) can change your site and tried to log in. It was not approved by you. If you know who it belongs to, approve it here. If not, do not approve it: someone may have created it to take over your site.' => 'Akaunti %1$s (%2$s) inaweza kubadilisha tovuti yako na ilijaribu kuingia. Haijaidhinishwa na wewe. Ikiwa unajua ni ya nani, iidhinishe hapa. Ikiwa hujui, usiiidhinishe: huenda mtu aliiunda ili kuteka tovuti yako.',
    'The link works once and expires in 24 hours.' => 'Kiungo kinafanya kazi mara moja na kinaisha muda baada ya saa 24.',
    'Draco Insomnis' => 'Draco Insomnis',
    'https://github.com/fermatacordis-create/draco-insomnis' => 'https://github.com/fermatacordis-create/draco-insomnis',
    'Notorius Vision · OPNV Systems' => 'Notorius Vision · OPNV Systems',
    'https://notoriusvision.com' => 'https://notoriusvision.com',
    'Trusted devices skip only the verification code. Administrator co-sign approval remains mandatory.' => 'Vifaa vinavyoaminika huruka msimbo wa uthibitisho pekee. Idhini ya pamoja ya msimamizi inabaki kuwa lazima.',
    'Recovery e-mails configured' => 'Barua pepe za kurejesha zimewekwa',
    'Second administrator approval' => 'Idhini ya msimamizi wa pili',
    'Trusted devices' => 'Vifaa vinavyoaminika',
    'Allow the microphone for this site (OPNV Accessibility voice commands)' => 'Ruhusu maikrofoni kwa tovuti hii (amri za sauti za Ufikivu wa OPNV)',
    'Only when security headers are on. Reading aloud never needs the microphone. Voice commands do: this sets microphone=(self) so this site may ask for it, while camera, location and embeds stay blocked.' => 'Pale tu vichwa vya usalama vimewashwa. Kusoma kwa sauti hakuhitaji maikrofoni kamwe. Amri za sauti zinahitaji: hii inaweka microphone=(self) ili tovuti hii iweze kuiomba, huku kamera, mahali na maudhui yaliyopachikwa yakibaki yamezuiwa.',
    'Malicious links (URLhaus)' => 'Viungo hatari (URLhaus)',
    'Links in comments and contact forms are checked against URLhaus, the list of malware sites kept by abuse.ch. The list is downloaded twice a day with your own key and checked on this server: nothing your visitors write is sent anywhere. A comment with a listed link goes to spam; a contact message with one is not delivered.' => 'Viungo katika maoni na fomu za mawasiliano hulinganishwa na URLhaus, orodha ya tovuti za programu hasidi inayotunzwa na abuse.ch. Orodha hupakuliwa mara mbili kwa siku kwa ufunguo wako mwenyewe na hukaguliwa kwenye seva hii: hakuna kitu ambacho wageni wako wanaandika kinachotumwa popote. Maoni yenye kiungo kilichoorodheshwa huenda kwenye taka; ujumbe wa mawasiliano wenye kiungo kama hicho hauwasilishwi.',
    'Free use only for non-profit websites; for commercial use, a Spamhaus subscription.' => 'Bure tu kwa tovuti zisizo za faida; kwa matumizi ya kibiashara, usajili wa Spamhaus.',
    'That is what the abuse.ch terms of use say for URLhaus.' => 'Hivyo ndivyo masharti ya matumizi ya abuse.ch kwa URLhaus yanavyosema.',
    'Terms of use' => 'Masharti ya matumizi',
    'Spamhaus subscription' => 'Usajili wa Spamhaus',
    'To use it, create a free account at auth.abuse.ch, copy your Auth-Key and add this line to wp-config.php. The key stays there: it is never saved in the database or shown on any screen.' => 'Ili kuitumia, fungua akaunti ya bure kwenye auth.abuse.ch, nakili Auth-Key yako na uongeze mstari huu kwenye wp-config.php. Ufunguo unabaki pale: hauhifadhiwi kamwe kwenye hifadhidata wala kuonyeshwa kwenye skrini yoyote.',
    'your-key' => 'your-key',
    'Key found in wp-config.php.' => 'Ufunguo umepatikana kwenye wp-config.php.',
    'Last download: %1$s, %2$d entries.' => 'Upakuaji wa mwisho: %1$s, maingizo %2$d.',
    'Last attempt failed: %s.' => 'Jaribio la mwisho limeshindwa: %s.',
    'I confirm this website is non-profit, or has a Spamhaus subscription' => 'Ninathibitisha kwamba tovuti hii si ya faida, au ina usajili wa Spamhaus',
    'Check links in comments and contact forms' => 'Kagua viungo katika maoni na fomu za mawasiliano',
    'Download the list now' => 'Pakua orodha sasa',
    'Recent submissions cleared. Blocked addresses stay on the block list.' => 'Mawasilisho ya hivi karibuni yamefutwa. Anwani zilizozuiwa zinabaki kwenye orodha ya kuzuia.',
    'Address unblocked.' => 'Anwani imeondolewa kizuizi.',
    'Malicious links were not switched on: add your abuse.ch key to wp-config.php first.' => 'Viungo hatari havikuwashwa: kwanza ongeza ufunguo wako wa abuse.ch kwenye wp-config.php.',
    'Malicious links were not switched on: confirm first that the site is non-profit or has a Spamhaus subscription.' => 'Viungo hatari havikuwashwa: kwanza thibitisha kwamba tovuti si ya faida au ina usajili wa Spamhaus.',
    'URLhaus list downloaded: %d entries.' => 'Orodha ya URLhaus imepakuliwa: maingizo %d.',
    'The URLhaus list could not be downloaded (%s). Links are not checked until it is.' => 'Orodha ya URLhaus haikuweza kupakuliwa (%s). Viungo havikaguliwi hadi ipakuliwe.',
    'Each submission is kept for 90 days, confirmed or not. "Block" works on any row — including after they confirm from their e-mail: confirming only proves the mailbox exists, not that it can be trusted. "Deliver now" lets a real submission through without waiting.' => 'Kila wasilisho huhifadhiwa kwa siku 90, likithibitishwa au la. "Zuia" hufanya kazi kwenye safu yoyote — hata baada ya kuthibitisha kutoka kwenye barua pepe yao: kuthibitisha kunaonyesha tu kwamba sanduku la barua lipo, si kwamba linaaminika. "Tuma sasa" huruhusu wasilisho halisi kupita bila kusubiri.',
    'Clear all recent submissions from this list? Blocked addresses stay on the block list. This cannot be undone.' => 'Futa mawasilisho yote ya hivi karibuni kutoka kwenye orodha hii? Anwani zilizozuiwa zinabaki kwenye orodha ya kuzuia. Hili haliwezi kutenduliwa.',
    'Clear list' => 'Futa orodha',
    'Block confirmed sender' => 'Zuia mtumaji aliyethibitishwa',
    'DRACO_COSIGN_OFF is set in wp-config.php: a second administrator is not required to co-sign. Remove that line once you are back in.' => 'DRACO_COSIGN_OFF imewekwa kwenye wp-config.php: msimamizi wa pili hahitajiki kutoa idhini ya pamoja. Ondoa mstari huo ukishaingia tena.',
    'Trusted devices skip only the verification code. A second administrator approval is still required when CoSign is enabled.' => 'Vifaa vinavyoaminika huruka msimbo wa uthibitisho pekee. Idhini ya pamoja ikiwa imewashwa, idhini ya msimamizi wa pili bado inahitajika.',
    'Administrator co-sign' => 'Idhini ya pamoja ya msimamizi',
    'A second administrator must approve this sign-in. The session belongs only to the first account.' => 'Msimamizi wa pili lazima aidhinishe kuingia huku. Kipindi ni cha akaunti ya kwanza pekee.',
    'Service accounts cannot be used for co-sign approval.' => 'Akaunti za huduma haziwezi kutumika kutoa idhini ya pamoja.',
    'Trust Device is not a trusted login: passwords A and B and co-sign stay mandatory; only the e-mail code may be skipped. Prefer a quiet approval account (Admin B) with its own mailbox, unused on the public site.' => '"Amini kifaa" si kuingia kunakoaminika: nenosiri A na B pamoja na idhini ya pamoja zinabaki kuwa lazima; ni msimbo wa barua pepe tu unaoweza kurukwa. Ni bora kuwa na akaunti tulivu ya kuidhinisha (Admin B) yenye sanduku lake la barua, isiyotumika kwenye tovuti ya umma.',
    'This account needs a second administrator to co-sign. Log in from %s.' => 'Akaunti hii inahitaji idhini ya pamoja ya msimamizi wa pili. Ingia kutoka %s.',
    'The co-signature step has expired. Log in again.' => 'Hatua ya idhini ya pamoja imeisha muda. Ingia tena.',
    'The co-signature could not be verified.' => 'Idhini ya pamoja haikuweza kuthibitishwa.',
    'A second administrator must co-sign before %s can finish logging in.' => 'Msimamizi wa pili lazima atoe idhini ya pamoja kabla %s haijamaliza kuingia.',
    'Administrator co-signature' => 'Idhini ya pamoja ya msimamizi',
    'Co-signer username or e-mail' => 'Jina la mtumiaji au barua pepe ya mwidhinishaji wa pili',
    'Co-signer password' => 'Nenosiri la mwidhinishaji wa pili',
    'Co-sign and continue' => 'Idhinisha na uendelee',
    'A recovery e-mail was removed from your account.' => 'Barua pepe ya kurejesha imeondolewa kwenye akaunti yako.',
    'Your password has been reset. The next login code will go to your primary recovery e-mail.' => 'Nenosiri lako limewekwa upya. Msimbo unaofuata wa kuingia utaenda kwenye barua pepe yako kuu ya kurejesha.',
    'We have sent a code to that recovery address. Type it below to remove it.' => 'Tumetuma msimbo kwenye anwani hiyo ya kurejesha. Uandike hapa chini ili kuiondoa.',
    'Recovery e-mail removed.' => 'Barua pepe ya kurejesha imeondolewa.',
    'That address is already one of your recovery e-mails.' => 'Anwani hiyo tayari ni moja ya barua pepe zako za kurejesha.',
    'You already have three recovery e-mails. Remove one to add another.' => 'Tayari una barua pepe tatu za kurejesha. Ondoa moja ili kuongeza nyingine.',
    'You need at least one recovery e-mail while the login code is on.' => 'Unahitaji angalau barua pepe moja ya kurejesha wakati msimbo wa kuingia umewashwa.',
    'Up to three mailboxes for your login code, like nested PUKs. Prefer providers different from your main e-mail (for example Gmail if the main one is on this site\'s domain).' => 'Hadi masanduku matatu ya barua kwa msimbo wako wa kuingia, kama PUK za akiba. Ni bora watoa huduma tofauti na barua pepe yako kuu (kwa mfano Gmail ikiwa kuu iko kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii).',
    'Recovery e-mails' => 'Barua pepe za kurejesha',
    'Slots in use: %d of 3' => 'Nafasi zinazotumika: %d kati ya 3',
    'Remove' => 'Ondoa',
    'Primary recovery' => 'Urejeshaji mkuu',
    'Replace with…' => 'Badilisha kwa…',
    'Replace' => 'Badilisha',
    'Add recovery e-mail' => 'Ongeza barua pepe ya kurejesha',
    'On the code screen you can ask for the code to go to a recovery address instead.' => 'Kwenye skrini ya msimbo unaweza kuomba msimbo uende kwenye anwani ya kurejesha badala yake.',
    '"Lost your password?" also accepts any of these addresses, and the link goes there.' => '"Umesahau nenosiri?" pia hukubali anwani yoyote kati ya hizi, na kiungo huenda huko.',
    'After a password reset, the next code goes to your primary recovery address.' => 'Baada ya kuweka upya nenosiri, msimbo unaofuata huenda kwenye anwani yako kuu ya kurejesha.',
    'Any change is told to your main mailbox and to the address that was replaced or removed.' => 'Mabadiliko yoyote hujulishwa kwenye sanduku lako kuu la barua na kwenye anwani iliyobadilishwa au kuondolewa.',
    'From recent messages (%s)' => 'Kutoka kwenye jumbe za hivi karibuni (%s)',
    'Country or Global…' => 'Nchi au Ulimwenguni…',
    'Country or Global' => 'Nchi au Ulimwenguni',
    'Provider' => 'Mtoa huduma',
    'Preferably a mailbox on the domain of this site, @%1$s. Country → provider fills SMTP server, encryption and port automatically (shown in the note and editable below). If yours is missing, type the server by hand (often mail.%2$s) and confirm it with them.' => 'Ni bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii, @%1$s. Nchi → mtoa huduma hujaza seva ya SMTP, usimbaji fiche na mlango kiotomatiki (huonyeshwa kwenye dokezo na kuharirika hapa chini). Ikiwa wako haupo, andika seva mwenyewe (mara nyingi mail.%2$s) na uthibitishe nao.',
    'Filled when you choose a provider. You can still edit it. Your provider gives it to you.' => 'Hujazwa unapochagua mtoa huduma. Bado unaweza kuihariri. Mtoa huduma wako hukupa.',
    'Filled with the provider preset. Some providers use other values — check the note and change them here if needed.' => 'Imejazwa kwa mpangilio wa awali wa mtoa huduma. Watoa huduma wengine hutumia thamani nyingine — angalia dokezo na uzibadilishe hapa ikihitajika.',
    'Template host' => 'Seva ya kiolezo',
    'Check before you trust this preset' => 'Kagua kabla ya kuamini mpangilio huu wa awali',
    'Connection preset' => 'Mpangilio wa awali wa muunganisho',
    'Encryption' => 'Usimbaji fiche',
    'Fill this from your hosting panel (assigned per account).' => 'Ijaze kutoka kwenye paneli ya upangishaji wako (hutolewa kwa kila akaunti).',
    'Choosing a provider fills SMTP server, encryption and port below automatically. You can still edit them.' => 'Kuchagua mtoa huduma hujaza seva ya SMTP, usimbaji fiche na mlango hapa chini kiotomatiki. Bado unaweza kuvihariri.',
    'Recent messages cleared.' => 'Jumbe za hivi karibuni zimefutwa.',
    '%s is blocked. Messages and sign-ups from that address are held or refused.' => '%s imezuiwa. Jumbe na usajili kutoka kwenye anwani hiyo hushikiliwa au kukataliwa.',
    'Nothing was blocked: the address is not valid, belongs to an administrator, or is your own.' => 'Hakuna kilichozuiwa: anwani si sahihi, ni ya msimamizi, au ni yako mwenyewe.',
    'Block this address?' => 'Zuia anwani hii?',
    '"Accepted" means the server took it, not that it reached the inbox. With PHP mail(), not even that. Message bodies are never stored. You can clear the list, or block an address that confirmed a form or sign-up.' => '"Imekubaliwa" maana yake seva imeipokea, si kwamba imefika kwenye kikasha. Kwa PHP mail(), hata hilo halijulikani. Maudhui ya jumbe hayahifadhiwi kamwe. Unaweza kufuta orodha, au kuzuia anwani iliyothibitisha fomu au usajili.',
    'Clear all recent messages from this list? This cannot be undone.' => 'Futa jumbe zote za hivi karibuni kutoka kwenye orodha hii? Hili haliwezi kutenduliwa.',
    'Global' => 'Ulimwenguni',
    'BD — Bangladesh' => 'BD — Bangladeshi',
    'BR — Brazil' => 'BR — Brazili',
    'CN — China' => 'CN — Uchina',
    'CO — Colombia' => 'CO — Kolombia',
    'DE — Germany' => 'DE — Ujerumani',
    'ES — Spain' => 'ES — Hispania',
    'ET — Ethiopia' => 'ET — Ethiopia',
    'FR — France' => 'FR — Ufaransa',
    'HK — Hong Kong' => 'HK — Hong Kong',
    'ID — Indonesia' => 'ID — Indonesia',
    'IN — India' => 'IN — India',
    'IQ — Iraq' => 'IQ — Iraki',
    'MX — Mexico' => 'MX — Meksiko',
    'NL — Netherlands' => 'NL — Uholanzi',
    'PL — Poland' => 'PL — Polandi',
    'RU — Russia' => 'RU — Urusi',
    'TR — Türkiye' => 'TR — Uturuki',
    'UK — United Kingdom' => 'UK — Ufalme wa Muungano',
    'US — United States' => 'US — Marekani',
    'VN — Vietnam' => 'VN — Vietnamu',
    'This provider uses a host that depends on your domain or the server assigned to your account. Fill the outgoing server as shown, or copy it from your hosting panel.' => 'Mtoa huduma huyu hutumia seva inayotegemea kikoa chako au seva uliyopewa kwenye akaunti yako. Jaza seva ya kutuma kama inavyoonyeshwa, au inakili kutoka kwenye paneli ya upangishaji.',
    'Titan Email (smtp.titan.email, 465 SSL) is used by several hostings (Bluehost Professional Email, HostGator Brasil Titan, BigRock Titan, IraqHosting business mail…).' => 'Titan Email (smtp.titan.email, 465 SSL) hutumiwa na kampuni kadhaa za upangishaji (Bluehost Professional Email, HostGator Brasil Titan, BigRock Titan, barua pepe ya biashara ya IraqHosting…).',
    'Also documented: port 587 with STARTTLS/TLS if 465 fails.' => 'Imeandikwa pia: mlango 587 kwa STARTTLS/TLS ikiwa 465 itashindwa.',
    'Use the normal mailbox password. SSL on 465 is the usual setting.' => 'Tumia nenosiri la kawaida la sanduku la barua. SSL kwenye 465 ndio mpangilio wa kawaida.',
    'IONOS hosts differ by country: .es, .de and .com are not interchangeable.' => 'Seva za IONOS hutofautiana kwa nchi: .es, .de na .com haziwezi kubadilishana.',
    'Official alternative host: smtp.mail.ovh.net (same 465 SSL).' => 'Seva mbadala rasmi: smtp.mail.ovh.net (465 SSL ileile).',
    '123 Reg Professional Email currently uses the same GoDaddy Titan host (smtpout.secureserver.net).' => '123 Reg Professional Email kwa sasa hutumia seva ileile ya Titan ya GoDaddy (smtpout.secureserver.net).',
    'Spanish hosting mail. Prefer a mailbox on this site’s domain.' => 'Barua pepe ya upangishaji ya Hispania. Ni bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii.',
    'EU datacentre. With two-step verification, create an app password.' => 'Kituo cha data ndani ya EU. Ukiwa na uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili, unda nenosiri la programu.',
    'Authenticated SMTP must be enabled for the mailbox in the Microsoft 365 admin centre.' => 'SMTP iliyothibitishwa lazima iwashwe kwa sanduku la barua kwenye kituo cha usimamizi cha Microsoft 365.',
    'Requires an app password (or SMTP relay for Workspace). Normal Google password will not work with 2FA.' => 'Inahitaji nenosiri la programu (au SMTP relay kwa Workspace). Nenosiri la kawaida la Google halifanyi kazi na 2FA.',
    'Transactional relay: use the SMTP login and key from Brevo, not the mailbox password.' => 'Relay ya miamala: tumia kuingia kwa SMTP na ufunguo kutoka Brevo, si nenosiri la sanduku la barua.',
    'Relay for a verified domain in Mailgun.' => 'Relay kwa kikoa kilichothibitishwa kwenye Mailgun.',
    'Username must be the literal word “apikey”; password is the API key.' => 'Jina la mtumiaji lazima liwe neno "apikey" lenyewe; nenosiri ni ufunguo wa API.',
    'Username and password are both the Server API Token.' => 'Jina la mtumiaji na nenosiri vyote ni Server API Token.',
    'API key as username, secret key as password.' => 'Ufunguo wa API kama jina la mtumiaji, ufunguo wa siri kama nenosiri.',
    'Region Ireland (eu-west-1). Create SMTP credentials in SES; do not use your AWS console password.' => 'Eneo la Ayalandi (eu-west-1). Unda vitambulisho vya SMTP kwenye SES; usitumie nenosiri la koni ya AWS.',
    'Personal Microsoft account. Prefer a mailbox on this site’s domain for deliverability.' => 'Akaunti binafsi ya Microsoft. Ili jumbe zifike, ni bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii.',
    'Requires an app password. Not ideal as the site’s main sender.' => 'Inahitaji nenosiri la programu. Si bora kama mtumaji mkuu wa tovuti.',
    'Requires an app-specific password from appleid.apple.com.' => 'Inahitaji nenosiri maalum la programu kutoka appleid.apple.com.',
    'Different product from GoDaddy Professional Email (Titan). Authenticated SMTP must be allowed in Microsoft 365.' => 'Bidhaa tofauti na GoDaddy Professional Email (Titan). SMTP iliyothibitishwa lazima iruhusiwe kwenye Microsoft 365.',
    'In the EU, Bluehost documents smtp0101.titan.email as a variant.' => 'Ndani ya EU, Bluehost huandika smtp0101.titan.email kama aina nyingine.',
    'Host is often {server}.hostgator.com or mail.{domain}. Copy it from HostGator.' => 'Seva mara nyingi ni {server}.hostgator.com au mail.{domain}. Inakili kutoka HostGator.',
    'Reliable sources agree, but no direct official URL was found. You must enable IMAP/SMTP and use a 16-character authorization code (normal password fails).' => 'Vyanzo vya kuaminika vinakubaliana, lakini hakuna URL rasmi ya moja kwa moja iliyopatikana. Lazima uwashe IMAP/SMTP na utumie msimbo wa idhini wenye herufi 16 (nenosiri la kawaida hushindwa).',
    'Reliable sources agree; no direct official URL. Safe preset is 465 SSL only. Enable IMAP/SMTP and use an authorization code.' => 'Vyanzo vya kuaminika vinakubaliana; hakuna URL rasmi ya moja kwa moja. Mpangilio salama ni 465 SSL pekee. Washa IMAP/SMTP na utumie msimbo wa idhini.',
    'Official docs: ports 80 and 587 are not available for SMTP. Use 465 SSL only. Enable third-party clients / client password.' => 'Nyaraka rasmi: milango 80 na 587 haipatikani kwa SMTP. Tumia 465 SSL pekee. Washa programu za wahusika wengine / nenosiri la programu.',
    'Official docs: ports 80 and 587 are not available for SMTP. Use 465 SSL only.' => 'Nyaraka rasmi: milango 80 na 587 haipatikani kwa SMTP. Tumia 465 SSL pekee.',
    'Reliable sources agree; no direct official URL. App password required if Secure Login is on.' => 'Vyanzo vya kuaminika vinakubaliana; hakuna URL rasmi ya moja kwa moja. Nenosiri la programu linahitajika ikiwa Kuingia Salama kumewashwa.',
    'Same Hostinger SMTP worldwide. Use the mailbox password.' => 'SMTP ileile ya Hostinger duniani kote. Tumia nenosiri la sanduku la barua.',
    'Mailhostbox product (not Titan). Confirm the regional host in the BigRock panel if login fails.' => 'Bidhaa ya Mailhostbox (si Titan). Thibitisha seva ya kanda kwenye paneli ya BigRock ikiwa kuingia kunashindwa.',
    'Their WP-Mail-SMTP guide uses mail.{domain}.com.br style hosts and prefers 587/STARTTLS.' => 'Mwongozo wao wa WP-Mail-SMTP hutumia seva za mtindo wa mail.{domain}.com.br na hupendelea 587/STARTTLS.',
    'Mailbox product on Locaweb. Prefer a mailbox on this site’s domain.' => 'Bidhaa ya sanduku la barua ya Locaweb. Ni bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii.',
    'Transactional SMTP product (smtplw.com.br), separate from Email Locaweb.' => 'Bidhaa ya SMTP ya miamala (smtplw.com.br), tofauti na Email Locaweb.',
    'Same host as GoDaddy Titan. Old smtp.123-reg.co.uk is not in current official docs.' => 'Seva ileile ya GoDaddy Titan. smtp.123-reg.co.uk ya zamani haipo kwenye nyaraka rasmi za sasa.',
    'Their guide uses 587/STARTTLS for hosting mail.' => 'Mwongozo wao hutumia 587/STARTTLS kwa barua pepe ya upangishaji.',
    'Host is the assigned server (e.g. chv4-24911.azdigi.com). Copy it from AZDIGI.' => 'Seva ni ile uliyopewa (k.m. chv4-24911.azdigi.com). Inakili kutoka AZDIGI.',
    'Pro Mail host (not the same as cPanel hosting mail).' => 'Seva ya Pro Mail (si sawa na barua pepe ya upangishaji wa cPanel).',
    'Host looks like proXX.emailserver.vn or svXXdXXX.emailserver.vn — copy from Mat Bao.' => 'Seva huonekana kama proXX.emailserver.vn au svXXdXXX.emailserver.vn — inakili kutoka Mat Bao.',
    'Host looks like mailXX.maychuemail.com — assigned per account.' => 'Seva huonekana kama mailXX.maychuemail.com — hutolewa kwa kila akaunti.',
    'Linux hosting mail. Confirm in the reg.ru panel if your plan uses another host.' => 'Barua pepe ya upangishaji wa Linux. Thibitisha kwenye paneli ya reg.ru ikiwa mpango wako unatumia seva nyingine.',
    'Documented limit: 30 messages/min and 1500/hour over SMTP.' => 'Kikomo kilichoandikwa: jumbe 30/dakika na 1500/saa kupitia SMTP.',
    'Shared Timeweb SMTP for hosting mailboxes.' => 'SMTP ya pamoja ya Timeweb kwa masanduku ya barua ya upangishaji.',
    'Enable IMAP and use an app password.' => 'Washa IMAP na utumie nenosiri la programu.',
    'Their WordPress guide documents 587 without encryption for hosting mail. Corporate mail is a different product. Prefer STARTTLS if the server allows it.' => 'Mwongozo wao wa WordPress unaandika 587 bila usimbaji fiche kwa barua pepe ya upangishaji. Barua pepe ya kampuni ni bidhaa nyingine. Pendelea STARTTLS ikiwa seva inaruhusu.',
    'Corporate product (mail.kurumsaleposta.com), not hosting mail.' => 'Bidhaa ya kampuni (mail.kurumsaleposta.com), si barua pepe ya upangishaji.',
    'Encryption not stated clearly in the source; try STARTTLS on 587 first.' => 'Usimbaji fiche haujaelezwa wazi kwenye chanzo; jaribu kwanza STARTTLS kwenye 587.',
    'Mailmatik outgoing host (giden.mailmatik.com).' => 'Seva ya kutuma ya Mailmatik (giden.mailmatik.com).',
    'OX App Suite enterprise mail (smtp.us.appsuite.cloud), not hosting mail.' => 'Barua pepe ya biashara ya OX App Suite (smtp.us.appsuite.cloud), si barua pepe ya upangishaji.',
    'Their guide prefers 587/STARTTLS.' => 'Mwongozo wao hupendelea 587/STARTTLS.',
    'SSL required; TLS 1.2+. 465 also documented — switch encryption/port below if 587 fails.' => 'SSL inahitajika; TLS 1.2+. 465 pia imeandikwa — badilisha usimbaji fiche/mlango hapa chini ikiwa 587 itashindwa.',
    'Their docs mark STARTTLS as unused: prefer 465 SSL. 587 is without SSL.' => 'Nyaraka zao zinaonyesha STARTTLS kama haitumiki: pendelea 465 SSL. 587 haina SSL.',
    'Only 587/TLS is documented. On their VPS, ports 25 and 465 are blocked by default — do not force 465.' => 'Ni 587/TLS pekee iliyoandikwa. Kwenye VPS zao, milango 25 na 465 imezuiwa kwa chaguo-msingi — usilazimishe 465.',
    'Same Alibaba rule: no port 587 for SMTP; use 465 SSL.' => 'Kanuni ileile ya Alibaba: hakuna mlango 587 kwa SMTP; tumia 465 SSL.',
    'Official docs recommend 587/STARTTLS at the top and 465/SSL in detailed steps — both work. Prefer 587 first; you can change encryption/port below.' => 'Nyaraka rasmi zinapendekeza 587/STARTTLS juu na 465/SSL kwenye hatua za kina — zote zinafanya kazi. Jaribu 587 kwanza; unaweza kubadilisha usimbaji fiche/mlango hapa chini.',
    'Host pattern: yourdomain.correoseguro.dinaserver.com.' => 'Muundo wa seva: yourdomain.correoseguro.dinaserver.com.',
    'Current official page uses authsmtp.securemail.pro (not the older smtp-es.securemail.pro).' => 'Ukurasa rasmi wa sasa unatumia authsmtp.securemail.pro (si smtp-es.securemail.pro ya zamani).',
    'Or the cPanel hostname assigned to your account.' => 'Au jina la seva la cPanel ulilopewa kwenye akaunti yako.',
    'Not interchangeable with smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.com.' => 'Haiwezi kubadilishana na smtp.ionos.de wala smtp.ionos.com.',
    'Strato mailbox SMTP. Prefer a mailbox on this site’s domain.' => 'SMTP ya sanduku la barua la Strato. Ni bora sanduku la barua kwenye kikoa cha tovuti hii.',
    'Not interchangeable with smtp.ionos.es or smtp.ionos.com.' => 'Haiwezi kubadilishana na smtp.ionos.es wala smtp.ionos.com.',
    'Or {server}.o2switch.net — copy from o2switch.' => 'Au {server}.o2switch.net — inakili kutoka o2switch.',
    'Host is the hosting server hostname for your account.' => 'Seva ni jina la seva ya upangishaji ya akaunti yako.',
    'TransIP mailbox SMTP.' => 'SMTP ya sanduku la barua la TransIP.',
    'Exception: Hostnet’s standard is 587/STARTTLS, not 465/SSL. Do not force 465. Guide also mentions mailout.hostnet.nl.' => 'Isipokuwa: kiwango cha Hostnet ni 587/STARTTLS, si 465/SSL. Usilazimishe 465. Mwongozo pia unataja mailout.hostnet.nl.',
    'Host looks like serwerNNNNNN.home.pl — assigned per account.' => 'Seva huonekana kama serwerNNNNNN.home.pl — hutolewa kwa kila akaunti.',
    'Host looks like serverNNNNNN.nazwa.pl — assigned per account.' => 'Seva huonekana kama serverNNNNNN.nazwa.pl — hutolewa kwa kila akaunti.',
    'mi.com.co documents 587/STARTTLS as the standard outgoing setting.' => 'mi.com.co inaandika 587/STARTTLS kama mpangilio wa kawaida wa kutuma.',
    'Write the abuse address of the network that owns this IP address. Your hosting provider or the regional internet registry of the address can tell you which one it is.' => 'Andika anwani ya kuripoti matumizi mabaya (abuse) ya mtandao unaomiliki anwani hii ya IP. Mtoa huduma wako wa upangishaji au sajili ya intaneti ya kanda ya anwani hiyo wanaweza kukuambia ni upi.',
    'Blocked addresses stay here until you unblock them or they expire. Clearing the list above does not remove them. Forms and sign-ups from a blocked address get the same “almost done” answer as everyone else, so they cannot tell.' => 'Anwani zilizozuiwa hubaki hapa hadi uziondolee kizuizi au muda wake uishe. Kufuta orodha iliyo juu hakuziondoi. Fomu na usajili kutoka kwenye anwani iliyozuiwa hupata jibu lilelile la "karibu imekamilika" kama kila mtu, kwa hivyo hawawezi kujua.',
    'Full block list in Anti-bot shield →' => 'Orodha kamili ya kuzuia kwenye Ngao dhidi ya roboti →',
    'Registration is complete. Check your email for details!' => 'Usajili umekamilika. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako.',
    'One at a time: type an address, get its code and confirm it before going on to the next one.' => 'Moja baada ya nyingine: andika anwani, pokea msimbo wake na uuthibitishe kabla ya kwenda kwenye inayofuata.',
    'Confirm the previous one first.' => 'Thibitisha kwanza iliyotangulia.',
    'Verified' => 'Imethibitishwa',
    'Free' => 'Wazi',
    'PHP %s gets security updates' => 'PHP %s hupokea masasisho ya usalama',
    'PHP %1$s gets security updates from php.net only until %2$s: choose a newer one in your hosting panel' => 'PHP %1$s itapokea masasisho ya usalama kutoka php.net hadi %2$s pekee: chagua toleo jipya zaidi kwenye paneli ya upangishaji',
    'PHP %1$s has had no security updates from php.net since %2$s: choose a newer one in your hosting panel' => 'PHP %1$s haijapokea masasisho ya usalama kutoka php.net tangu %2$s: chagua toleo jipya zaidi kwenye paneli ya upangishaji',
    'Hide versions on public pages (WordPress, theme and plugins)' => 'Ficha matoleo kwenye kurasa za umma (WordPress, mandhari na programu-jalizi)',
    'Takes out the "generator" tags and turns "?ver=" of styles and scripts into a code that still changes on every update. It makes the site harder to list for robots looking for old versions; it does not fix anything: keep everything updated. readme.html and license.txt are sent by the web server without WordPress, so no plugin can refuse them: refuse them in the server.' => 'Huondoa lebo za "generator" na hubadilisha "?ver=" ya mitindo na hati kuwa msimbo unaoendelea kubadilika kila sasisho. Roboti zinazotafuta matoleo ya zamani hupata ugumu zaidi kuiweka tovuti kwenye orodha zao; hairekebishi chochote: sasisha kila kitu. readme.html na license.txt hutumwa na seva ya wavuti bila WordPress, kwa hivyo hakuna programu-jalizi inayoweza kuzikataa: zikatae kwenye seva.',
    'content' => 'maudhui',
    'search' => 'utafutaji',
    'user accounts' => 'akaunti za watumiaji',
    '"Answer" is what the visitor got: 401 means the door was closed, 200 that the content was sent. Anonymous visitors always get 401 from /wp/v2/users/me, with or without Draco.' => '"Jibu" ni kile mgeni alichopata: 401 inamaanisha mlango ulifungwa, 200 kwamba maudhui yalitumwa. Wageni wasiojulikana daima hupata 401 kutoka /wp/v2/users/me, iwe na Draco au bila.',
    'Answer' => 'Jibu',
    'Publish /.well-known/security.txt (how to report a security problem)' => 'Chapisha /.well-known/security.txt (jinsi ya kuripoti tatizo la usalama)',
    'The standard file (RFC 9116) that tells whoever finds a weakness how to reach you. Draco renews its expiry date by itself.' => 'Faili ya kawaida (RFC 9116) inayomwambia anayepata udhaifu jinsi ya kukufikia. Draco husasisha tarehe yake ya kuisha yenyewe.',
    'Not possible here: the standard wants the file at the root of the domain, and this WordPress is in a folder.' => 'Haiwezekani hapa: kiwango kinataka faili kwenye mzizi wa kikoa, na WordPress hii iko ndani ya folda.',
    'Contact (e-mail or https:// address)' => 'Mawasiliano (barua pepe au anwani ya https://)',
    'Policy page (optional, https://)' => 'Ukurasa wa sera (hiari, https://)',
    'Not published yet: write a valid contact.' => 'Bado haijachapishwa: andika mawasiliano halali.',
    'looking for configuration and keys' => 'inatafuta usanidi na funguo',
    'looking for backup copies' => 'inatafuta nakala rudufu',
    'looking for logs' => 'inatafuta kumbukumbu',
    'looking for server information pages' => 'inatafuta kurasa za taarifa za seva',
    'looking for database tools' => 'inatafuta zana za hifadhidata',
    'looking for installers' => 'inatafuta visakinishi',
    'trying a known exploit' => 'inajaribu udukuzi unaojulikana',
    'looking for a back door' => 'inatafuta mlango wa nyuma',
    'Kept for 90 days. "Evidence" downloads everything from that address for an abuse report. In log-only mode they appear as "Would block". Rows from an administrator\'s address (your own tests) are marked, cannot be reported and do not count in the summary.' => 'Huhifadhiwa siku 90. "Ushahidi" hupakua kila kitu kutoka kwa anwani hiyo kwa ajili ya ripoti ya matumizi mabaya. Katika hali ya kurekodi tu yanaonekana kama "Ingezuia". Safu kutoka anwani ya msimamizi (majaribio yako mwenyewe) huwekwa alama, haziwezi kuripotiwa na hazihesabiwi kwenye muhtasari.',
    'Your address (administrator)' => 'Anwani yako (msimamizi)',
  ),
);
